sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant A as App
    participant S as Supabase

    U->>A: Launch app
    A->>S: auth.getUser()

    opt signed in
        S-->>A: user
    end

    opt signed out
        A->>A: Onboarding -> Get Started
    end

    A->>A: Home

    U->>A: Browse / Search / Map / Detail
    A->>S: Query properties
    S-->>A: Property data

    U->>A: Save / Chat / Create post / Profile
    opt guest
        A->>U: Login / Register
        U->>A: Email / Google
        A->>S: Authenticate
        S-->>A: session
    end

    A->>S: Perform action
    S-->>A: Confirmation

    U->>A: Exit app
    A->>A: End
